1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,211
‪BETTER LATE THAN SINGLE:
‪AFTER SERVICE

2
00:00:03,795 --> 00:00:07,007
‪UNSPOKEN QUESTIONS THEY NEVER DARED TO ASK

3
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:09,968
‪FINALLY SHARED THROUGH THE TRUTH GAME

4
00:00:10,051 --> 00:00:13,012
‪BETTER ANSWERED
‪THAN LEFT WONDERING

5
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:17,934
‪RULE 1. THE QUESTIONER
‪SITS IN THE CHAIR ON STAGE

6
00:00:18,518 --> 00:00:22,188
‪RULE 2. THEY READ THE QUESTION ON THE CARD
‪EXACTLY AS WRITTEN

7
00:00:22,272 --> 00:00:24,899
‪Oh, this is a tough one…

8
00:00:24,983 --> 00:00:28,695
‪"Han-ju, when did your heart race
‪the most while we were flirting?"

9
00:00:29,279 --> 00:00:31,781
‪RULE 3. THE RESPONDENT MUST TELL THE TRUTH

10
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:35,035
‪What's with the expression?

11
00:00:39,164 --> 00:00:40,915
‪FIRST QUESTIONER: SEUNG-HYUN

12
00:00:41,499 --> 00:00:42,667
‪Jeez, why me?

13
00:00:50,467 --> 00:00:51,885
‪-Get up there.
‪-Up you go.

14
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:53,136
‪Let's find out his true feelings.

15
00:00:58,141 --> 00:01:00,393
‪-Why is this so funny?
‪-I know, right?

16
00:01:04,898 --> 00:01:05,774
‪Question one.

17
00:01:07,609 --> 00:01:08,485
‪"Soo-hyun."

18
00:01:11,404 --> 00:01:16,993
‪"How did you feel when you heard
‪you were my final selection?"

19
00:01:17,077 --> 00:01:19,162
‪"Did you consider choosing me at all?"

20
00:01:20,622 --> 00:01:23,249
‪DURING THE FINAL SELECTION

21
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:25,710
<i>‪So I plan to pick Soo-hyun.</i>

22
00:01:28,046 --> 00:01:31,800
‪SOO-HYUN HEADED ELSEWHERE

23
00:01:36,763 --> 00:01:39,641
‪THE FINAL SELECTION HAS ENDED

24
00:01:39,724 --> 00:01:41,601
‪HOW DID YOU FEEL WHEN YOU HEARD
‪YOU WERE MY FINAL SELECTION?

25
00:01:41,684 --> 00:01:42,977
‪DID YOU CONSIDER CHOOSING ME AT ALL?

26
00:01:43,061 --> 00:01:44,270
‪Well, I was very grateful.

27
00:01:46,356 --> 00:01:49,067
‪-It was down to the wire.
‪-Right.

28
00:01:49,150 --> 00:01:51,152
‪And it meant a lot
‪that you expressed your interest in me.

29
00:01:51,236 --> 00:01:54,114
‪My self-esteem was
‪at an all-time low, you see.

30
00:01:55,865 --> 00:01:57,450
‪I was grateful

31
00:01:57,534 --> 00:01:59,577
‪because you worked up
‪the courage to tell me.

32
00:01:59,661 --> 00:02:01,955
‪I felt thankful, but…

33
00:02:04,916 --> 00:02:07,210
‪I think my mind was already made up.

34
00:02:09,921 --> 00:02:12,132
‪But I felt grateful at the time.

35
00:02:12,215 --> 00:02:14,384
‪And I still do.

36
00:02:14,467 --> 00:02:15,426
‪-That's good, then.
‪-Yes.

37
00:02:17,095 --> 00:02:18,805
‪Okay. Next question.

38
00:02:24,269 --> 00:02:25,103
‪"Su-ji."

39
00:02:29,983 --> 00:02:32,277
‪"You said you came to Jinju
‪to do something."

40
00:02:34,279 --> 00:02:36,364
‪"What was it, aside from seeing me?"

41
00:02:40,952 --> 00:02:42,537
‪I was there with my family.

42
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:45,123
‪But I figured since I was there

43
00:02:45,206 --> 00:02:46,916
‪and he lives there…

44
00:02:49,419 --> 00:02:50,879
‪I suggested we should hang out.

45
00:02:50,962 --> 00:02:53,214
‪-So we met up and had fun, right?
‪-Right.

46
00:02:53,298 --> 00:02:54,883
‪-We had a great time.
‪-We did.

47
00:02:55,383 --> 00:02:57,802
‪Hey, what's going on with you two?

48
00:02:57,886 --> 00:02:59,512
‪What is it?

49
00:03:04,058 --> 00:03:05,393
‪I don't want to do this.

50
00:03:05,476 --> 00:03:06,311
‪NEXT QUESTIONER: SU-JI

51
00:03:06,394 --> 00:03:07,562
‪I don't want to go up.

52
00:03:09,272 --> 00:03:10,690
‪I feel so exposed up here.

53
00:03:16,195 --> 00:03:17,322
‪Oh, come on!

54
00:03:26,664 --> 00:03:28,458
‪"Seung-hyun."

55
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:38,176
‪"Seung-hyun, how did you feel
‪when we met up in Jinju?"

56
00:03:43,056 --> 00:03:44,140
‪Well, I…

57
00:03:46,226 --> 00:03:47,060
‪I'm sorry.

58
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,686
‪It's okay.

59
00:03:48,770 --> 00:03:49,687
‪-Right.
‪-It's fine.

60
00:03:49,771 --> 00:03:50,605
‪It really is.

61
00:03:50,688 --> 00:03:52,232
‪I mean…

62
00:03:53,650 --> 00:03:54,984
‪It was fun, right?

63
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:02,450
‪-Just settle this today and move on.
‪-Right.

64
00:04:03,993 --> 00:04:06,621
‪To be honest, I really had fun that day.

65
00:04:07,121 --> 00:04:08,498
‪-Wow.
‪-It was fun.

66
00:04:08,581 --> 00:04:09,749
‪What made it so fun?

67
00:04:10,333 --> 00:04:12,377
‪-Say that your heart fluttered.
‪-Say it.

68
00:04:13,962 --> 00:04:15,880
‪I'd be lying if I said it didn't.

69
00:04:18,883 --> 00:04:20,635
‪What? I didn't hear what you said.

70
00:04:20,718 --> 00:04:22,011
‪He said his heart fluttered!

71
00:04:24,472 --> 00:04:25,390
‪Thank you.

72
00:04:26,140 --> 00:04:27,141
‪Done.

73
00:04:28,893 --> 00:04:32,146
‪NEXT QUESTIONER: SOO-HYUN

74
00:04:32,230 --> 00:04:33,231
‪What's inside?

75
00:04:34,232 --> 00:04:35,775
‪-Don't get excited.
‪-"Don't get excited"?

76
00:04:43,283 --> 00:04:45,159
‪-What is it?
‪-Tell us.

77
00:04:45,243 --> 00:04:47,120
‪-It must be funny.
‪-I think so too.

78
00:04:50,373 --> 00:04:51,791
‪I can't read this.

79
00:04:51,874 --> 00:04:52,792
‪Be brave.

80
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:55,378
‪I don't think I can.

81
00:04:57,338 --> 00:04:59,173
‪Then reject the question!

82
00:04:59,716 --> 00:05:01,301
‪You've got this, Kim Soo-hyun.

83
00:05:04,762 --> 00:05:05,930
‪"Tae-hoon."

84
00:05:07,432 --> 00:05:10,560
‪"How did you feel when you heard
‪you were my final selection?"

85
00:05:10,643 --> 00:05:14,105
<i>‪I plan to pick Tae-hoon</i>
<i>‪for the final selection.</i>

86
00:05:14,188 --> 00:05:17,984
<i>‪He made me look forward to each day.</i>

87
00:05:18,067 --> 00:05:20,278
<i>‪When else would I feel</i>
<i>‪butterflies like this?</i>

88
00:05:21,029 --> 00:05:22,447
<i>‪I gave it a lot of thought, but…</i>

89
00:05:22,530 --> 00:05:24,615
‪BUT TAE-HOON LEFT
‪ETERNAL SINGLES' VILLAGE ALONE

90
00:05:24,699 --> 00:05:29,537
‪HOW DID YOU FEEL WHEN YOU HEARD
‪YOU WERE MY FINAL SELECTION?

91
00:05:31,122 --> 00:05:33,791
‪-I only heard about this recently.
‪-Right.

92
00:05:36,419 --> 00:05:38,880
‪I'm very grateful that you selected me.

93
00:05:40,006 --> 00:05:41,799
‪Right. Okay.

94
00:05:46,012 --> 00:05:48,389
‪What? I can't read this!

95
00:05:55,897 --> 00:05:56,731
‪"Tae-hoon."

96
00:06:01,152 --> 00:06:04,155
‪"On our date, you said
‪I was your final pick."

97
00:06:04,238 --> 00:06:05,740
‪"So why the sudden change of heart?"

98
00:06:06,949 --> 00:06:08,868
‪-He said that?
‪-Wow.

99
00:06:11,913 --> 00:06:13,081
‪Do you think it might change?

100
00:06:13,831 --> 00:06:14,749
‪You mean my top pick?

101
00:06:17,627 --> 00:06:19,420
‪I'm talking to her right now.

102
00:06:20,088 --> 00:06:21,214
‪I'm very satisfied.

103
00:06:21,798 --> 00:06:22,840
‪I'm talking to her.

104
00:06:23,674 --> 00:06:25,176
‪So, you're satisfied?

105
00:06:25,259 --> 00:06:27,386
‪Yes. I'll give you 100 points for that.

106
00:06:28,304 --> 00:06:29,347
‪I'm sorry.

107
00:06:29,430 --> 00:06:30,556
‪Boo, Hoon-tae Kim.

108
00:06:32,475 --> 00:06:33,684
‪Well,

109
00:06:34,685 --> 00:06:39,107
‪it's true that I was interested in you
‪because we had good conversations.

110
00:06:40,066 --> 00:06:41,859
‪But there wasn't much time left,

111
00:06:41,943 --> 00:06:46,239
‪and I was worried
‪that rushing into a decision

112
00:06:46,864 --> 00:06:49,367
‪might end up ruining things.

113
00:06:50,243 --> 00:06:53,454
‪I should've told you
‪my decision sooner, but I didn't.

114
00:06:54,205 --> 00:06:56,040
‪I'm sorry for avoiding it for so long.

115
00:06:56,624 --> 00:06:57,500
‪Apology accepted.

116
00:06:59,293 --> 00:07:04,173
‪NEXT QUESTIONER: TAE-HOON

117
00:07:14,016 --> 00:07:16,936
‪"Soo-hyun, do you regret choosing me
‪as your final selection?"

118
00:07:17,770 --> 00:07:18,855
‪No, not at all.

119
00:07:18,938 --> 00:07:22,024
‪Even now, I don't regret it.

120
00:07:23,401 --> 00:07:24,819
‪-You're so cool.
‪-I'm impressed.

121
00:07:24,902 --> 00:07:26,279
‪So cool.

122
00:07:26,779 --> 00:07:27,947
‪I'm sorry.

123
00:07:28,531 --> 00:07:30,074
‪What a bad guy!

124
00:07:30,158 --> 00:07:31,742
‪You're apologizing a lot today.

125
00:07:36,205 --> 00:07:37,248
‪"Su-ji."

126
00:07:37,748 --> 00:07:39,083
‪Why me?

127
00:07:40,209 --> 00:07:42,920
‪"Did you never once have
‪romantic feelings for me?

128
00:07:43,588 --> 00:07:44,714
‪I'm sorry.

129
00:07:46,883 --> 00:07:48,634
‪I'm sorry. I never did.

130
00:07:52,472 --> 00:07:55,850
‪NEXT QUESTIONER: SEO-YOON

131
00:08:04,108 --> 00:08:05,067
‪Oh dear.

132
00:08:05,902 --> 00:08:07,570
‪-"Jae-seo."
‪-Yes?

133
00:08:09,113 --> 00:08:11,115
‪"During our secret date,

134
00:08:11,199 --> 00:08:15,328
‪you told me,
‪'This might be your last date today.'"

135
00:08:15,411 --> 00:08:16,829
‪"Why did you say that?"

136
00:08:17,747 --> 00:08:19,916
‪I've had a lot of one-on-one conversations

137
00:08:19,999 --> 00:08:21,083
‪-Before this?
‪-with the guys.

138
00:08:21,167 --> 00:08:22,627
‪I should be talking to the women,

139
00:08:22,710 --> 00:08:24,962
‪-but I just talk with the guys.
‪-Same here.

140
00:08:25,046 --> 00:08:27,423
‪So I have a clear idea
‪of who people's top picks are.

141
00:08:27,507 --> 00:08:30,885
‪-Since you talked a lot one-on-one.
‪-And how many dates they'll go on.

142
00:08:30,968 --> 00:08:33,429
‪This might be your last date today.

143
00:08:34,680 --> 00:08:35,765
‪Me?

144
00:08:36,849 --> 00:08:38,726
‪That's so mean.

145
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:42,021
‪I thought having some information

146
00:08:42,688 --> 00:08:46,192
‪would make things less difficult
‪and help you prepare.

147
00:08:47,109 --> 00:08:49,946
‪Some people find peace of mind
‪by anticipating everything

148
00:08:50,029 --> 00:08:51,656
‪and being prepared.

149
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:55,952
‪I made the mistake of assuming
‪that most people are like that.

150
00:08:56,035 --> 00:08:58,079
‪That's why I said that.

151
00:08:59,330 --> 00:09:01,958
‪I understand why
‪you might've been offended.

152
00:09:02,708 --> 00:09:03,626
‪Okay.

153
00:09:08,756 --> 00:09:09,674
‪"Jae-seo."

154
00:09:10,299 --> 00:09:11,217
‪"Are you sure

155
00:09:13,135 --> 00:09:15,638
‪you lost the arm wrestling match
‪on purpose?"

156
00:09:17,306 --> 00:09:18,558
‪Want me to show you again?

157
00:09:19,475 --> 00:09:21,018
<i>‪When I learned that we were arm wrestling,</i>

158
00:09:21,102 --> 00:09:22,603
‪I thought, "Not bad."

159
00:09:22,687 --> 00:09:25,523
<i>‪I saw Seo-yoon's photocard at fifth place,</i>

160
00:09:25,606 --> 00:09:28,609
‪and the results didn't matter
‪to me anymore.

161
00:09:28,693 --> 00:09:30,319
<i>‪So I put on a show.</i>

162
00:09:30,403 --> 00:09:31,571
‪I'm no match for him.

163
00:09:31,654 --> 00:09:34,574
<i>‪I pretended to be humiliated.</i>

164
00:09:34,657 --> 00:09:35,491
‪It's so embarrassing.

165
00:09:35,575 --> 00:09:36,993
‪Hold on a second. You know…

166
00:09:37,076 --> 00:09:38,661
‪You want to fact-check, don't you?

167
00:09:38,744 --> 00:09:40,913
‪There's no such thing as
‪"pretending" to be humiliated.

168
00:09:40,997 --> 00:09:43,082
‪-Let it go.
‪-He's lying, right?

169
00:09:43,708 --> 00:09:44,667
‪It's not what I think it is, right?

170
00:09:44,750 --> 00:09:47,169
‪Hold on, are we doing this with no chairs?

171
00:09:47,253 --> 00:09:48,546
‪-Should we get on our knees?
‪-I think so.

172
00:09:48,629 --> 00:09:49,463
‪Sit in the middle.

173
00:09:49,547 --> 00:09:51,257
‪-Sit down.
‪-You can be the referee.

174
00:09:51,340 --> 00:09:52,341
‪What are we doing?

175
00:09:53,843 --> 00:09:55,928
‪That's a perfect shot.

176
00:09:59,473 --> 00:10:00,391
‪-Ready.
‪-We're starting?

177
00:10:03,728 --> 00:10:05,479
‪Looking good!

178
00:10:08,065 --> 00:10:09,650
‪Ready.

179
00:10:18,492 --> 00:10:19,744
‪Go!

180
00:10:36,677 --> 00:10:37,887
‪And that's it.

181
00:10:39,013 --> 00:10:39,847
‪Good job.

182
00:10:39,930 --> 00:10:40,890
‪-You did well.
‪-Well done.

183
00:10:41,557 --> 00:10:43,684
‪-Jae-seo probably lost too much weight.
‪-He did.

184
00:10:43,768 --> 00:10:44,810
‪ARM WRESTLING A/S FAILED

185
00:10:44,894 --> 00:10:46,771
‪He's become a softie.

186
00:10:47,730 --> 00:10:51,317
‪NEXT QUESTIONER: HYUN-SEO

187
00:10:53,027 --> 00:10:54,654
‪Thank you.

188
00:11:01,994 --> 00:11:03,120
‪What is it?

189
00:11:03,204 --> 00:11:04,288
‪Why are you laughing?

190
00:11:04,372 --> 00:11:06,707
‪It's really funny
‪to see everyone from here.

191
00:11:16,342 --> 00:11:17,593
‪What is it?

192
00:11:17,676 --> 00:11:18,761
‪What's going on?

193
00:11:23,099 --> 00:11:24,058
‪She's speechless.

194
00:11:24,141 --> 00:11:24,975
‪-She is.
‪-Why?

195
00:11:25,601 --> 00:11:26,769
‪-Why?
‪-What is it?

196
00:11:29,313 --> 00:11:30,523
‪-What's going on?
‪-What is it?

197
00:11:31,357 --> 00:11:33,692
‪"Hyuk-joon, remember when you said

198
00:11:33,776 --> 00:11:36,946
‪that if you had to pick one person
‪you weren't attracted to…

199
00:11:39,281 --> 00:11:41,325
‪it would be Su-ji?"

200
00:11:41,909 --> 00:11:45,162
‪There's someone I know
‪I'll be a bad match with for sure.

201
00:11:45,246 --> 00:11:46,539
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

202
00:11:47,373 --> 00:11:49,500
‪Su-ji isn't my type.

203
00:11:50,501 --> 00:11:51,335
‪Why not?

204
00:11:51,419 --> 00:11:53,170
‪YOU SAID YOU WEREN'T ATTRACTED TO SU-JI

205
00:11:53,254 --> 00:11:54,922
‪Oh, I see.

206
00:11:55,923 --> 00:11:58,134
‪"Are you sure
‪you were never attracted to Su-ji?"

207
00:12:06,183 --> 00:12:08,394
‪Yes, you were. I already know.

208
00:12:11,063 --> 00:12:12,731
‪In the beginning…

209
00:12:13,357 --> 00:12:14,692
‪I remember this exactly.

210
00:12:17,736 --> 00:12:21,532
‪I thought there was a big age gap
‪between Su-ji and me.

211
00:12:23,534 --> 00:12:27,037
‪There's an age gap
‪between my younger sibling and me,

212
00:12:27,121 --> 00:12:28,789
‪but Su-ji is even younger.

213
00:12:29,457 --> 00:12:33,085
‪So I thought it'd be difficult for me

214
00:12:33,169 --> 00:12:34,879
‪to develop romantic feelings for her.

215
00:12:36,922 --> 00:12:40,426
‪And I wasn't sure
‪if our personalities would be compatible.

216
00:12:46,932 --> 00:12:48,309
‪Su-ji's expression is funny.

217
00:12:48,392 --> 00:12:51,687
‪He's talking right next to me,
‪so I don't know how to react.

218
00:12:59,153 --> 00:13:00,237
‪"Hyuk-joon."

219
00:13:02,490 --> 00:13:05,075
‪"Didn't you ever worry
‪my feelings might change

220
00:13:05,159 --> 00:13:08,370
‪while you kept going on dates
‪with other women?"

221
00:13:10,873 --> 00:13:14,585
‪I'd be lying if I said I wasn't worried.

222
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:20,674
‪But we came on this show to date people.

223
00:13:20,758 --> 00:13:24,261
‪We even had conversations

224
00:13:24,345 --> 00:13:28,098
‪about how it would be good
‪to talk to other people as well.

225
00:13:29,099 --> 00:13:31,936
‪So when I was

226
00:13:32,019 --> 00:13:34,313
‪getting to know the other women,

227
00:13:34,396 --> 00:13:37,775
‪I figured you'd be doing the same
‪with the other guys.

228
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:42,821
‪Next up…

229
00:13:47,535 --> 00:13:49,203
‪Wait a minute.

230
00:13:49,787 --> 00:13:52,248
‪This is news to me, so…

231
00:13:53,999 --> 00:13:57,878
‪"Hyuk-joon, did you do the rounds
‪because you got upset at me

232
00:13:57,962 --> 00:13:59,964
‪for playing dumb about your gift?"

233
00:14:02,174 --> 00:14:04,718
‪But I never played dumb about your gift.

234
00:14:04,802 --> 00:14:05,970
‪What's this about?

235
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:09,723
‪Explain this.
‪This must be from your interview, sir.

236
00:14:10,474 --> 00:14:12,476
‪I think I was possessed at the time.

237
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:14,395
‪-I don't remember.
‪-That could happen.

238
00:14:14,979 --> 00:14:16,730
‪-Could you repeat?
‪-Can you read that again?

239
00:14:16,814 --> 00:14:20,568
‪"Hyuk-joon, did you do the rounds
‪because you got upset at me

240
00:14:20,651 --> 00:14:22,152
‪-for playing dumb--"
‪-I remember!

241
00:14:22,236 --> 00:14:24,655
‪I remember it exactly!

242
00:14:24,738 --> 00:14:27,491
‪What? You just said you didn't remember!

243
00:14:27,575 --> 00:14:29,201
‪That's what you said!

244
00:14:29,285 --> 00:14:30,828
‪-To be honest…
‪-All of a sudden?

245
00:14:30,911 --> 00:14:35,416
‪To be honest, there were a few things
‪that had upset me.

246
00:14:35,499 --> 00:14:36,959
‪That's why I did what I did.

247
00:14:37,042 --> 00:14:39,169
‪You were upset with me?

248
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:41,380
‪I mean, yes, I was upset…

249
00:14:42,381 --> 00:14:44,300
‪-So that much is true.
‪-It's true.

250
00:14:44,383 --> 00:14:47,052
‪I gave you a gift at the time,

251
00:14:47,136 --> 00:14:48,596
‪but when I asked if you got one,

252
00:14:48,679 --> 00:14:51,432
‪you said you hadn't.

253
00:14:52,433 --> 00:14:53,559
‪Have you received a gift?

254
00:14:54,143 --> 00:14:55,019
‪I haven't checked.

255
00:14:55,102 --> 00:14:56,437
‪-You haven't?
‪-No.

256
00:14:56,937 --> 00:14:59,023
‪You really didn't get anything?

257
00:14:59,690 --> 00:15:00,900
‪I'm not sure.

258
00:15:01,483 --> 00:15:06,488
‪I vaguely remember telling you that.

259
00:15:08,198 --> 00:15:10,284
‪I don't exactly remember why I said that,

260
00:15:10,367 --> 00:15:13,954
‪but I think it's because
‪I thought Seung-hyun gave it to me.

261
00:15:17,249 --> 00:15:21,754
‪I didn't want you to know
‪that I received a gift from someone else.

262
00:15:23,422 --> 00:15:26,133
‪I didn't want to confuse you.

263
00:15:26,216 --> 00:15:27,593
‪I think that's why I said that.

264
00:15:27,676 --> 00:15:32,932
‪AFTER THAT, HYUK-JOON WENT ON DATES
‪WITH DIFFERENT FEMALE PARTICIPANTS

265
00:15:33,015 --> 00:15:35,601
‪I think I was possessed at the time,
‪and I'm sorry.

266
00:15:35,684 --> 00:15:36,769
‪You should be.

267
00:15:37,394 --> 00:15:40,105
‪That was my mistake.

268
00:15:40,189 --> 00:15:41,357
‪It happens.

269
00:15:43,984 --> 00:15:45,361
‪-All done.
‪-All done.

270
00:15:49,657 --> 00:15:51,283
‪Goodness.

271
00:15:51,367 --> 00:15:53,118
‪NEXT QUESTIONER: HYUK-JOON

272
00:15:55,454 --> 00:15:56,622
‪Why am I tired already?

273
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:05,923
‪Why? What is it?

274
00:16:13,138 --> 00:16:14,348
‪"Hyun-seo."

275
00:16:16,600 --> 00:16:18,352
‪"When did I make your heart
‪race the most?"

276
00:16:22,231 --> 00:16:23,065
‪I'm curious.

277
00:16:23,148 --> 00:16:24,149
‪Well, I…

278
00:16:25,693 --> 00:16:29,905
‪I don't know how you'll take this,
‪but during the final selection,

279
00:16:31,532 --> 00:16:36,286
‪I was told I had to go and wait.

280
00:16:37,037 --> 00:16:40,332
‪But there was someone standing in my spot.

281
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:44,003
‪THE SPOT WHERE HYUN-SEO WAS TOLD TO GO

282
00:16:44,086 --> 00:16:47,464
‪HYUK-JOON WAS ALREADY STANDING THERE

283
00:16:47,548 --> 00:16:49,842
‪I thought you were some random tourist.

284
00:16:54,346 --> 00:16:57,558
‪HYUN-SEO STEPS OUT THE DOOR

285
00:16:57,641 --> 00:16:59,435
<i>‪But that tourist</i>

286
00:16:59,518 --> 00:17:01,812
<i>‪started walking toward me.</i>

287
00:17:01,895 --> 00:17:03,022
‪HYUK-JOON & HYUN-SEO
‪FINAL SELECTION

288
00:17:03,105 --> 00:17:05,232
<i>‪And I was struck by his silhouette.</i>

289
00:17:07,484 --> 00:17:09,695
‪So I thought,

290
00:17:09,778 --> 00:17:11,447
‪"I need to take him to Seoul with me."

291
00:17:13,991 --> 00:17:15,659
‪My heart's racing.

292
00:17:16,452 --> 00:17:17,953
‪But it turned out to be you.

293
00:17:19,913 --> 00:17:22,666
‪I decided to go with that person,
‪but it turned out to be you.

294
00:17:26,336 --> 00:17:28,380
‪-It's like a movie.
‪-This deserves applause.

295
00:17:28,464 --> 00:17:29,465
‪I know, right?

296
00:17:30,549 --> 00:17:31,842
‪It's like a K-drama.

297
00:17:33,761 --> 00:17:38,098
‪AFTER HAVING A HEART-TO-HEART

298
00:17:43,604 --> 00:17:48,984
‪HAN-JU AND JIN-WOO
‪REMAIN IN THE EMPTY THEATER

299
00:17:53,697 --> 00:17:57,326
‪THEY SIT RIGHT NEXT TO EACH OTHER

300
00:17:58,911 --> 00:18:01,538
‪DURING THE FINAL SELECTION

301
00:18:04,541 --> 00:18:08,754
‪THE PAIR WERE ON EDGE
‪UNTIL THE VERY END

302
00:18:09,338 --> 00:18:14,051
‪JIN-WOO & HAN-JU
‪FINAL SELECTION

303
00:18:14,635 --> 00:18:19,723
‪WHAT'S THEIR CURRENT STATUS?

304
00:18:27,606 --> 00:18:29,858
‪How did you feel watching everyone today?

305
00:18:31,485 --> 00:18:32,319
‪It was fun, right?

306
00:18:32,986 --> 00:18:34,655
‪All the behind-the-scenes talk…

307
00:18:35,823 --> 00:18:39,201
‪-It seemed everyone went through a lot.
‪-Right.

308
00:18:39,284 --> 00:18:42,079
‪I thought I'd gone over everything,

309
00:18:42,162 --> 00:18:43,831
‪but there were things I didn't know.

310
00:18:44,456 --> 00:18:47,376
‪-We remembered things differently too.
‪-Right.

311
00:18:50,587 --> 00:18:52,297
‪After the filming ended,

312
00:18:52,381 --> 00:18:55,217
‪I reached out to you first, right?

313
00:18:55,300 --> 00:18:56,844
‪I know it was a bit too soon…

314
00:18:58,220 --> 00:19:00,848
‪I was really torn on whether
‪to message you or not.

315
00:19:00,931 --> 00:19:02,975
‪I even asked my friends
‪if I should send it or not.

316
00:19:03,517 --> 00:19:06,937
‪If you hadn't reached out first,
‪I would've done it.

317
00:19:07,563 --> 00:19:11,400
‪Obviously, I wanted to
‪get to know you better

318
00:19:11,483 --> 00:19:15,571
‪ever since the final selection,
‪because that was the whole point.

319
00:19:15,654 --> 00:19:17,322
‪That's good to hear.

320
00:19:17,990 --> 00:19:19,449
‪I worried I might've pressured you.

321
00:19:19,533 --> 00:19:20,367
‪No.

322
00:19:21,285 --> 00:19:23,787
‪-So we kept in touch.
‪-Right.

323
00:19:25,038 --> 00:19:26,999
‪Then I said

324
00:19:27,082 --> 00:19:30,961
‪-we should just be friends.
‪-Yeah.

325
00:19:31,044 --> 00:19:35,716
‪But you didn't ask me why
‪or anything like that.

326
00:19:38,427 --> 00:19:39,469
‪I think

327
00:19:40,762 --> 00:19:43,140
‪it weighed on my mind.

328
00:19:46,268 --> 00:19:47,311
‪I'm only human,

329
00:19:48,061 --> 00:19:49,897
‪so getting a text like that hurt.

330
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:51,899
‪-Right.
‪-So then…

331
00:19:53,317 --> 00:19:55,819
‪To be honest, after I got your text,

332
00:19:56,528 --> 00:19:57,863
‪I struggled for about a week.

333
00:19:57,946 --> 00:19:59,156
‪-Really?
‪-Yeah.

334
00:20:00,490 --> 00:20:03,035
‪It wasn't an easy decision for me either.

335
00:20:03,118 --> 00:20:04,369
‪Yes, I know.

336
00:20:04,912 --> 00:20:06,288
‪I sat my younger sibling down

337
00:20:06,914 --> 00:20:08,916
‪and asked for advice a lot.

338
00:20:11,168 --> 00:20:12,920
‪That memory is what kept me going.

339
00:20:13,003 --> 00:20:14,963
‪You said a lot of good things to me.

340
00:20:15,047 --> 00:20:17,591
‪I mean, you know,

341
00:20:17,674 --> 00:20:19,885
‪it wasn't a polite brush-off.

342
00:20:21,261 --> 00:20:22,387
‪So…

343
00:20:23,555 --> 00:20:27,476
‪I didn't ask you for a reason
‪because I'd kind of seen it coming.

344
00:20:30,145 --> 00:20:32,898
‪As we kept in touch,

345
00:20:33,899 --> 00:20:36,985
‪it felt like we weren't able
‪to take that next step.

346
00:20:37,778 --> 00:20:39,238
‪So I got the feeling

347
00:20:39,321 --> 00:20:41,531
‪that this might not end well.

348
00:20:41,615 --> 00:20:43,575
‪That thought had already occurred to me

349
00:20:43,659 --> 00:20:46,328
‪when you texted.

350
00:20:46,411 --> 00:20:47,496
‪And it was a long text.

351
00:20:49,706 --> 00:20:53,168
‪We didn't get to meet one-on-one
‪right away after filming.

352
00:20:53,252 --> 00:20:54,086
‪Right.

353
00:20:54,670 --> 00:20:57,547
‪-I had to graduate, and you were busy.
‪-Right.

354
00:20:57,631 --> 00:21:01,134
‪-That's why we met up first as a group.
‪-Yes.

355
00:21:01,218 --> 00:21:04,596
‪After we all got together

356
00:21:05,347 --> 00:21:06,723
‪and had a good time,

357
00:21:08,183 --> 00:21:11,061
‪I worried that if things
‪just fizzled out between us…

358
00:21:13,272 --> 00:21:17,234
‪it would ruin our friendship
‪with everyone else too.

359
00:21:17,317 --> 00:21:20,779
‪I think I took a step back
‪because I was afraid of that.

360
00:21:22,155 --> 00:21:24,741
‪That's always been my problem, though.

361
00:21:24,825 --> 00:21:29,037
‪I tend to worry about the ending
‪before I've even started.

362
00:21:30,497 --> 00:21:33,417
‪I came on the show
‪to change that about myself.

363
00:21:34,042 --> 00:21:38,880
‪-I didn't want to lose you or the others.
‪-Right.

364
00:21:38,964 --> 00:21:41,174
‪That's what I was thinking,

365
00:21:41,258 --> 00:21:42,426
‪and that played a big part.

366
00:21:48,432 --> 00:21:50,100
‪Oh, I'm curious.

367
00:21:50,183 --> 00:21:52,060
‪Do you still prefer being called <i>‪nuna</i>‪?

368
00:21:52,144 --> 00:21:52,978
‪-Me?
‪-Yeah.

369
00:21:53,061 --> 00:21:54,438
‪It doesn't matter. Call me whatever.

370
00:21:54,521 --> 00:21:56,148
‪-It doesn't matter anymore, right?
‪-Right.

371
00:21:56,231 --> 00:21:57,274
‪I prefer calling you by your name.

372
00:22:00,736 --> 00:22:02,946
‪I really set you straight
‪and made you call me <i>‪nuna</i>‪.

373
00:22:03,447 --> 00:22:04,281
‪"Set me straight"?

374
00:22:04,364 --> 00:22:05,866
‪I wouldn't put it that way.

375
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:09,244
‪How's your love life lately?

376
00:22:12,080 --> 00:22:13,749
‪I've got nothing going on.

377
00:22:14,791 --> 00:22:16,043
‪What about you?

378
00:22:16,126 --> 00:22:18,378
‪Me? Absolutely nothing.

379
00:22:18,962 --> 00:22:20,213
‪I have no one to set me up

380
00:22:20,881 --> 00:22:22,132
‪and zero prospects.

381
00:22:23,383 --> 00:22:25,343
‪I'm sure once this show airs,

382
00:22:25,427 --> 00:22:27,512
‪a lookist like me will track you down.

383
00:22:28,138 --> 00:22:29,598
‪I don't think so.

384
00:22:30,348 --> 00:22:31,433
‪It's chilly.

385
00:22:31,516 --> 00:22:34,478
‪HYUK-JOON & HYUN-SEO

386
00:22:34,561 --> 00:22:36,104
‪I should've brought you a blanket too.

387
00:22:36,188 --> 00:22:37,355
‪No, I'm fine.

388
00:22:37,939 --> 00:22:41,526
‪I'm still feeling hot
‪from the talk we just had.

389
00:22:42,778 --> 00:22:44,821
‪It was cute. It's fine.

390
00:22:46,948 --> 00:22:51,078
‪But based on the questions I got,

391
00:22:51,161 --> 00:22:52,037
‪I think I have

392
00:22:52,954 --> 00:22:54,206
‪a rocky road ahead of me.

393
00:22:55,123 --> 00:22:57,834
‪But you reap what you sow.

394
00:22:57,918 --> 00:22:58,752
‪I know.

395
00:23:00,253 --> 00:23:01,379
‪You have to deal with it.

396
00:23:02,714 --> 00:23:04,299
‪I'm in big trouble.

397
00:23:05,425 --> 00:23:07,469
‪I didn't think much of it then, though.

398
00:23:07,552 --> 00:23:10,639
‪I really thought of the dates
‪as one-on-one conversations, nothing more.

399
00:23:15,560 --> 00:23:18,271
‪-To be really honest with you…
‪-Yeah.

400
00:23:18,355 --> 00:23:20,816
‪I'm saying this because it's just us here.

401
00:23:21,399 --> 00:23:23,193
‪After filming the show…

402
00:23:27,030 --> 00:23:28,365
‪I had a really hard time.

403
00:23:35,163 --> 00:23:36,832
<i>‪This is a huge misunderstanding.</i>

404
00:23:50,887 --> 00:23:52,889
‪Subtitle translation by:
‪Jenny Kim
